  "title": "Russian Plain is ours",
  "briefing": "Ironwood Trust holds Russian Plain through its switching yard. Download the records from the vault server, take down the site warden, unlock the service gate, then leave by the exit. Expect 7 enemy agents and 3 guards on the streets.",
